+    the existing 64-token partitions bounds memory, while each partition now
+    has six multiply/add levels rather than 64 serial levels. This matters on
+    strict W8A8 targets where every arithmetic output is requantized.
+
+    This is part of the PyTorch architecture, not an export-only rewrite: QAT,
+    eager evaluation and ONNX capture therefore train and execute the same
+    numerical function.
+    """
+    input_dtype = u.dtype
+    if delta.dtype != torch.float32:
+        delta = delta.float()
+    if delta_bias is not None:
